f='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a>! I love the meaning behind it. I may steal that idea. I'm still trying to convince my fianc\u00e9 that I should wear both my wedding bands right away, he thinks it should be an anniversary band. I love that you are still having a subtle way to remember the Meagan ceremony! I want to that too now! [emoji4]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432076104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf8b25452063397363b51c940e3385c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@yycbride2015 Thanks! No worries at all - steal away! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just didn&#039;t want to discredit our legal ceremony even though it&#039;s not the official \"wedding\" ceremony, it&#039;s still our legal date so it matters to us! It&#039;s such a unique situation when you get married twice and we kind of embraced it instead of just forgetting about it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906654,"PostDate":1445345815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@yycbride2015 Thanks! No worries at all - steal away! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just didn't want to discredit our legal ceremony even though it's not the official \"wedding\" ceremony, it's still our legal date so it matters to us! It's such a unique situation when you get married twice and we kind of embraced it instead of just forgetting about it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419412614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"880045e48ea0891feb0ddb936d2f3d80","RawContent":"You look GORGEOUS.. I love your dress! and what a great idea to make your belt! They can be SO expensive for such a small piece of fabric! \n\nLove the stacked rings also!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906666,"PostDate":1445370494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You look GORGEOUS.. I love your dress! and what a great idea to make your belt! They can be SO expensive for such a small piece of fabric! <br>\nLove the stacked rings also! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361712626,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f270787e381272624517cc53839390c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrsCtoB\"] Awww thank you!!! :) that makes me feel really good. I know! One of the belts I tried on in the bridal salon was $400&amp;nbsp; :mellow:&amp;nbsp;haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906678,"PostDate":1445407077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"266526\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/266526-mrsctob\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrsCtoB<\/span><\/a> Awww thank you!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> that makes me feel really good. I know! One of the belts I tried on in the bridal salon was $400\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/mellow.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':mellow:' \/>\u00a0haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419412614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1445413188,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b9c12d1821fc37b384279468819b612","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Feeling a little bit frustrated today. My Palace coordinator sent me my PO&#039;s and BO&#039;s a while back and I found some errors with pricing and our reception time not being extended until 11pm as I had requested. I was told I needed to pay by the end of last week, but my coordinator has still yet to respond back to my concern about the incorrect charges. It&#039;s been a week and a half since I emailed her..Hoping this will get worked out soon so that we can finally pay our balance with Palace.&amp;nbsp; -_-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re basically finished with 90% of the planning now with the exception of a few last minute things like escort cards (which I should be able to finish designing today - I had to wait to get our final payments to see who was 100% coming) and Chester and I have to work out the rest of the music\/start loading it into the iPad. Hoping the wedding DJ app will be a breeze for us since I am married to an IT guy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50 days until my group departs!! AHH!&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906684,"PostDate":1445413154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Feeling a little bit frustrated today. My Palace coordinator sent me my PO's and BO's a while back and I found some errors with pricing and our reception time not being extended until 11pm as I had requested. I was told I needed to pay by the end of last week, but my coordinator has still yet to respond back to my concern about the incorrect charges. It's been a week and a half since I emailed her..Hoping this will get worked out soon so that we can finally pay our balance with Palace.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sleep.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='-_-' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're basically finished with 90% of the planning now with the exception of a few last minute things like escort cards (which I should be able to finish designing today - I had to wait to get our final payments to see who was 100% coming) and Chester and I have to work out the rest of the music\/start loading it into the iPad. Hoping the wedding DJ app will be a breeze for us since I am married to an IT guy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#00ffff\"><span  style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>50 days until my group departs!! AHH!<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419412614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85d8517c815515b5e51103fb4bcc00c5","RawContent":"Hopefully you hear from her soon. Could you send another email? You&#039;d think they&#039;d want their money? :\/\n\n\nYou will be on your way before you know it. You&#039;ve done a great job. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906686,"PostDate":1445416373,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hopefully you hear from her soon. Could you send another email? You'd think they'd want their money? :\/<br><br>\nYou will be on your way before you know it. You've done a great job. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12f6b9c271b6511ac34623dc0b83de77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] That&#039;s what I thought too! haha. I did send them multiple emails because I want to get a few things figured out before I pay.. it&#039;s only stressing me out because I&#039;m not sure if I have to pay an additional $300 at this point or not.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906688,"PostDate":1445416504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calg